(text "RMX A0.2 / RELAY DRIVER AND AUDIO CONTACTS / DRAFT - no fabrication release" (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 28887e13-baf3-5a6d-ae06-c9a073debe8b))
(text "NC selects dry; NO selects processed. Both poles switch, permitting balanced harness use. All coil current returns directly to power ground." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 383d51cb-5fca-54dc-bcc5-c705870bbad5))
(text "K3 first releases the input mute; U33 delays K1/K2 reconnect. Q1/Q2 each have a local pull-down and separate 5V-powered 3V3 clamp." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 5480c0fe-d6ca-5d28-985f-7f963e113c56))
(text "D1 is a drain-to-ground unidirectional TVS, not a diode across the coils. Scope flyback energy, overshoot and release time." (at 15 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 6324ced9-7471-5a53-a2d4-a1b4b8bf651c))
